    {
      "claim_id": "CC323_LEAD",
      "claim_text": "Capital Chronicle's 5 November Main review delivers a blunt midterm lesson: the dossier's leading Democratic-sweep scenario occurred, yet US500, USTEC and Bitcoin rose against its downside mapping. Our market-direction map was wrong. Getting the political outcome right did not make the expected market response right.",
