    {
      "claim_id": "CC323_SESSIONS",
      "claim_text": "US500, the review says, continued climbing through Asia and Europe. Its sequence challenges a blanket account of these moves as starting only in the US session. The review locates Bitcoin's largest leg and oil's largest slide in that later session; it places gold's main move and US500's turn earlier.",
