    },
    {
      "claim_id": "CC323_CAUSAL_LIMIT",
      "claim_text": "Those windows help frame the question of what information was available at each stage. Their alignment does not establish that election calls caused the moves, and the hourly reconstruction cannot identify a precise trigger.",
